WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.137
Today we will represent a place through organised sounds. Our work connects with our

00:00:05.137 --> 00:00:06.195
own local community.

00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:09.444
List three sounds heard in the chosen setting.

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:14.212
Assign each sound to a gentle vocal or body action.

00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:19.001
Perform the sounds in order to represent morning, afternoon or evening.
